WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:16.933
Swampy forest clearings like this one are found

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:20.437
throughout the Congo Basin

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.149
in the local language.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:29.654
They are known as Bais

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:31.781
free from the shade of the canopy.

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:38.371
Smaller plants flourish, creating

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.541
vital pit stops for grazing animals

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:46.337
but Bais are more

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:49.591
than just forest clearings.

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:53.344
They are places where salt
and other minerals

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.432
are hidden in the ground.

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:04.898
Many elephants are nervous
being out in the open

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.692
due to poaching

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.822
only under the cover of darkness.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:17.035
Does this bull step out of the shadows

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.624
and into the Bai

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.050
filmed here

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:35.804
for the first time using only Moonlight,

00:01:36.971 --> 00:01:39.015
he knows exactly

00:01:39.015 --> 00:01:44.145
where to go.

00:01:44.145 --> 00:01:46.481
The salt and minerals he needs

00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:52.320
are buried in the riverbed,

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:56.699
and he has the perfect multi-tool to mine

00:01:56.699 --> 00:01:57.826
for them

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.544
blowing jets of air,

00:02:08.837 --> 00:02:11.756
he breaks up the sediments,

00:02:11.756 --> 00:02:14.092
creating a rich, salty

00:02:14.259 --> 00:02:18.596
soup.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:26.146
His trunk acts as a jackhammer, cup

00:02:26.896 --> 00:02:29.482
and straw.

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:37.615
He barely spills a drop.

00:02:37.615 --> 00:02:41.661
The sound of the bull mining is a beacon

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:45.498
signaling to the more cautious

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:48.042
forest residents that tonight

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:54.716
this Bai is safe.

